---
permalink: /en/sostenibilidad/certificaciones/
title: "Certifications & awards"
description: "Green Destinations, Marca Perú, SERNANP, Por la Conservación, ESNNA and more: the certifications and awards behind Ecocruceros."
---
{% set t = i18n[lang] %}

<nav class="container breadcrumbs" aria-label="breadcrumb" style="padding-top:var(--space-8)"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span>›</span><a href="/en/sostenibilidad/">Sustainability</a><span>›</span> Certifications</nav>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:var(--space-8)">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Certifications</p>
    <h1>Credentials you can verify</h1>
    <p class="lead">We don't use stamps as decoration: each certification has a meaning.</p>
    <div class="cert-grid" style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      {% for c in site.certs %}
      <div class="cert">
        {% if c.verify %}
        <a class="cert__link" href="{{ c.verify }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Verify: {{ c.name }} (opens in a new tab)">
          <div class="cert__logo"><img src="/assets/img/certs/{{ c.img }}" alt="{{ c.name }}" loading="lazy" width="88" height="88"></div>
          <b>{{ c.name }}</b>
          <span class="cert__verify">Verify →</span>
        </a>
        {% else %}
        <div class="cert__logo"><img src="/assets/img/certs/{{ c.img }}" alt="{{ c.name }}" loading="lazy" width="88" height="88"></div>
        <b>{{ c.name }}</b>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Recognition</p>
    <h2>Awards &amp; press</h2>
    <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)">
      <div class="card"><div class="card__body"><h3>2025 sustainable tourism award</h3><p>Recognition for promoting sustainable tourism.</p></div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card__body"><h3>PromPerú</h3><p>Featured our Palomino Islands tours (2025).</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)"><div class="card__body"><h3>TripAdvisor</h3><p>4.6★ · 193 reviews · #10 of 97 tours in Lima. <a href="{{ site.tripadvisor.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See profile →</a></p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
